## A. Coverage criterion (the judgement anchor)

A report counts as covering frontend/style.css iff BOTH hold, judged on the report's
FRONTMATTER ONLY (the region between the first two `---` lines):

  (1) `status: passed`
  (2) its `covered_files:` list contains a line matching exactly `  - frontend/style.css`

Full-text grep is NOT the criterion. A report that merely MENTIONS frontend/style.css in
